---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Support"
description: "Common questions about Cueport: library setup, Serato write-back, phone pairing, cue points, offline use, and what is out of scope."
permalink: /support/
viewportMain: true
---

<div class="container">
  <div class="page-head">
    <h1 class="visually-hidden">Support</h1>
    <p class="lede">Browse common questions about Cueport. Send feature requests and bug reports to <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="paper-qa">
    {%- for item in faq %}
    <article class="paper-qa-item">
      <h2 class="paper-q"><span class="paper-q-mark" aria-hidden="true">Q.</span> {{ item.question | escape | replace("Wi-Fi", '<span class="nowrap">Wi-Fi</span>') | safe }}</h2>
      <p>{{ item.answer | replace("Wi-Fi", '<span class="nowrap">Wi-Fi</span>') | safe }}</p>
    </article>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</div>
